<title>USA: Meritage Hospitality names CFO.</title>
<headline>Meritage Hospitality names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meritage Hospitality Group Inc said on Wednesday that it has named William Badgerow as vice president, treasurer and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Badgerow was previously chief financial officer and vice president of EIP Financial Services Inc, Meritage said.</p>
<p>It could not immediately be determined if Badgrow's position were newly created or if he were succeeding someone in the post.</p>
</text>
